<p><strong>Clients of advisors with Canada-only mandates:</strong> The week''''s key story, the NFP-to-Fed-probability-to-gold chain, requires understanding US monetary policy to be properly framed for Canadian portfolios. Advisors with narrow mandates may not have provided this context. An advisor who explains the US-Canada linkage clearly creates an immediate differentiation.</p>
